config BR2_PACKAGE_QRTR
	bool "qrtr"
	depends on BR2_TOOLCHAIN_HAS_THREADS
	help
	  Userspace library and tools for the Qualcomm IPC Router
	  protocol, used to talk to the modem and DSP subsystems.

	  https://github.com/linux-msm/qrtr

comment "qrtr needs a toolchain w/ threads"
	depends on !BR2_TOOLCHAIN_HAS_THREADS
